# DeepInfra's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-deepinfra-setting-api-key = A DeepInfra API key from https://deepinfra.com/dash/api_keys, without a "Bearer " prefix. It must be allowed to read billing data.

## The report: the prepaid balance, the billing cycle's spend, and whether
## the account is suspended. A suspension reason stays as DeepInfra sends it.

# Money the account owes DeepInfra.
usage-deepinfra-owed = Owed
# Prepaid money left.
usage-deepinfra-available = Available
usage-deepinfra-cycle-spend = Billing cycle spend
usage-deepinfra-month-spend = Spent this month
# A fact's label, and its value when DeepInfra gives no reason.
usage-deepinfra-suspended = Suspended
usage-deepinfra-account = Account
